1
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Once the police have him,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

2
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>they can investigate him</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

3
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:48,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and we'll know who he really is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

4
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

5
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>PREVIOUSLY</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

6
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who's that, Sergeant?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

7
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The Captain's ex-girlfriend.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Her name is Ya.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

8
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We need to find Chansuek</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>before Kamnan Sawaeng.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

9
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's the witness.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

10
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Got it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

11
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:06,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You don't know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

12
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is the place.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

13
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:17,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did I hear "a haew forest?"</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

14
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:20,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where are they? I like eating </c.white></c.bg_transparent><c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>haew.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

15
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You might have misunderstood.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

16
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:27,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's actually "heuw,"</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a northern dialect meaning cemetery.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

17
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

18
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:30,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You let the girl help Chan?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

19
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain Chansuek really came here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

20
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

21
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:45,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you hand the suspect over</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to Kamnan Sawaeng?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

22
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

23
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then how do you explain</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the fire at his house?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

24
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you all gone mad?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

25
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The fire was caused by a short circuit.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

26
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It has nothing to do with the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

27
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:05,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I heard that Kamnan Sawaeng's son</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

28
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>ordered his men to hunt down</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the very suspect we are looking for.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

29
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So what?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

30
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng is an influential figure.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

31
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Some people like him and some don't.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

32
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're defending him</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

33
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>as if you're his personal bodyguard.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

34
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

35
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're crossing the line.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

36
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get out of my station.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

37
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get out!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

38
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is outside the law now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

39
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:04,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can we report him to your boss</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and have him dealt with?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

40
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is classified.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

41
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They keep it hidden,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>especially from the press.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

42
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:13,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have any idea</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>why it must be kept secret?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

43
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Isn't something off?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

44
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I believe that from now on,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

45
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>things are getting more dangerous.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

46
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you think I'm scared?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

47
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I beg you, Ya.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

48
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't want you in trouble.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

49
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You can be angry with me all you want.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

50
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Wait!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

51
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Superintendent Cheewin handed</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chansuek over to Kamnan Sawaeng.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

52
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,000
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>But Chansuek escaped.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

53
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:54,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch! Hey! You!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

54
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It hurts! Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

55
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Gentler, please!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

56
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:01,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Is this a human hand or a bear paw?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

57
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:03,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Shut up or do it yourself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

58
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just be gentle. Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

59
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Ouch! That hurts!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Done.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

60
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

61
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:16,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod, you're fortunate</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to live up to your name and survive.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

62
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just don't understand.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

63
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:23,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why is everyone hunting me down</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>over that diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

64
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

65
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You really know nothing about it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

66
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:29,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

67
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You still don't believe me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

68
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:35,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I even turned myself in</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and look what happened.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

69
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I almost died.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

70
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who could have known</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

71
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the cops would hand you over</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to Kamnan Sawaeng?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

72
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I trusted them too much.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

73
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've never learned.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

74
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

75
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have some serious history</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with them or what?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

76
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

77
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just said it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

78
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But seriously,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

79
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>do you know nothing about the diamond?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

80
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

81
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't even know who I am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

82
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How am I supposed to know about that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

83
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

84
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what do we do next?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

85
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:13,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We can't rely on the police anymore</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

86
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and I still don't even know who I am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

87
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:20,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Everything happens for a reason.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

88
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I suggest</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

89
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you take your time and reflect.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

90
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sometimes,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

91
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you have to</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

92
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:33,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>look inward to find your own answers.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

93
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

94
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What does</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

95
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>he mean by that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

96
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't get it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

97
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

98
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It means</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

99
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>think for yourself for once</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

100
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:54,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>instead of waiting for others</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to give you the answers.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

101
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:57,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Life isn't that simple.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

102
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Something like that.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

103
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:01,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Okay?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey, wait!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

104
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, wait! Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

105
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:07,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Jeez, what a rotten girl.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

106
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't even realize</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you were being scolded.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

107
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Was that a scolding?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

108
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:18,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Seems like it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

109
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:33,520
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>If he really has amnesia</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>and knows nothing about the diamond,</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

110
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,159
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>what should I do next?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

111
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

112
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you looking for?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

113
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My monk ID certificate.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

114
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is it lost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

115
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I haven't found it yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

116
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:38,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>where I dropped it or kept it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

117
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I see.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

118
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>MONK ID CERTIFICATE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

119
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>ORIGINAL PROFILE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>MR. PADEJ SAKSUEA</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

120
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Monk Padej?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

121
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Jong found it near the house.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

122
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This proves he really went</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to help his sidekick.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

123
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can I take a look?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

124
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This certificate is definitely fake.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

125
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll verify it again.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

126
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But right now, there's another matter.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

127
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Deputy Papon's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

128
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are trailing me like dogs.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

129
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If they manage to seize Chan first,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

130
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll be in trouble.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

131
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's simple enough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

132
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just buy them off.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

133
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's not that easy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

134
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I looked into him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

135
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The one named Captain Kan</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

136
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>can't be bought.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

137
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Plus, he won't let us go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

138
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:41,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are there really any incorruptible cops</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>left in this world?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

139
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Fine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

140
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What can we do about him then?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

141
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll do my best to block him,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

142
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but with Deputy Papon backing him,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

143
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>my hands are tied.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

144
