170
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

171
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:09,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come. Let me help.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

172
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,360
