<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could they vanish?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

177
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Niew.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

178
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,960
