179
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:37,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>yet you still want to harm them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

180
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

181
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:40,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

182
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:43,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that plotting harm against a virtuous monk</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

183
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:44,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>carries heavy karma?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

184
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It is a true sin.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

185
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:50,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Karma is the consequence of actions,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
