198
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are you feeling better?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

199
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:41,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Much better.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

200
