00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you talking about?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

209
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Follow me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

210
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Over here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

211
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Look, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

212
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,120
