289
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

290
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:04,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

291
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How's it going? Did you find them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

292
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:17,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just add more checkpoints!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

293
00:22:18,520 --> 00:22:20,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Search thoroughly. Do not let them escape.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

294
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:26,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

295
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:56,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is the situation?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

296
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng set up checkpoints</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at the town exits.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

297
00:22:59,800 --> 00:23:01,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They're searching every car.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

298
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>At the bus terminal,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>they're checking all passengers too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

299
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Like a lawless territory.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

300
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:10,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng has many subordinates.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

301
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:14,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By now, he has probably set up</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>roadblocks along the way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

302
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:17,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So what should we do now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

303
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:25,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>WANTED</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BOUNTY 100,000 BAHT</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

304
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:40,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's a wanted notice.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

305
00:23:40,360 --> 00:23:42,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There's a reward</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of 100,000 baht per person.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

306
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:44,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Your picture is here too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

307
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:50,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Damn it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

308
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:53,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hush! Keep it down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you being so loud?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

309
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:56,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We'll be caught and handed over</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to Kamnan Sawaeng.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

310
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:58,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Keep it down!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I'm just angry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

311
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:00,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is this wanted poster anyway?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

312
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:03,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They grab people to torture</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and extract information.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

313
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:04,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They are the criminals.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

314
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Besides, the cops</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>haven't even investigated him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

315
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:13,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng actually issued</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>this wanted poster himself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

316
00:24:13,120 --> 00:24:16,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This notice isn't an official document.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

317
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They've already branded us as criminals.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

318
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:21,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And the police here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>just look the other way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

319
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:23,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They do nothing. It's terrible.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

320
00:24:25,080 --> 00:24:27,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>With his men at checkpoints</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

321
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:28,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and villagers wanting the reward,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

322
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:31,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>how can we escape to Bangkok?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

323
00:24:31,800 --> 00:24:32,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Exactly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

324
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:35,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We'd end up at the next town at most.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

325
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:37,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

326
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:40,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We will walk through the forest,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

327
00:24:41,080 --> 00:24:42,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>taking a detour towards the border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

328
00:24:42,600 --> 00:24:43,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It'll be a long way,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

329
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:47,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but I believe no one will think</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

330
00:24:47,600 --> 00:24:49,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we would choose this route.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

331
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

332
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:59,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>brought trouble to everyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

333
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I am sorry, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

334
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:08,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

335
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:11,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I am sorry</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

336
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:13,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>for dragging you into this.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

337
00:25:13,800 --> 00:25:14,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm sorry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

338
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:19,120
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>I can't believe</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>he has a side that feels guilty.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

339
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:22,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

340
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do not blame yourself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

341
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:28,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When people meet</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

342
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:30,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and share a fate like this,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

343
00:25:30,360 --> 00:25:33,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>it is not a coincidence.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It is for a reason.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

344
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:36,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you study Dharma, you will know that</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

345
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:39,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we have met because of</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

346
00:25:39,360 --> 00:25:42,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the merit and karma we have made together.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

347
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

348
00:25:46,800 --> 00:25:47,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't overthink it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

349
00:25:58,680 --> 00:26:00,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you were them, where would you go?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

350
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

351
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What about you, Captain?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

352
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:06,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not a local.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

353
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:10,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I would find a local who knows the area</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

354
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or someone familiar with the maps.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

355
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:18,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then we would know where</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain Chansuek and his group had fled.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

356
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:21,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who would help you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

357
00:26:25,280 --> 00:26:26,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There is one person.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

358
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:35,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why should I cooperate with you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

359
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You want this news, do you not?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

360
00:26:37,040 --> 00:26:40,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Weren't you the one</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who told me to stay out of this case?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

361
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:42,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we cooperate, I will protect you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

362
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:47,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You? Protect me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

363
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you agree to do everything I say,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

364
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:50,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you will be safe.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

365
00:26:55,360 --> 00:26:56,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

366
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:58,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you just want to control me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

367
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:03,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know I can't stop you from anything.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

368
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:07,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I thought this would</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>be better for both of us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

369
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:09,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm sorry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

370
00:27:09,640 --> 00:27:11,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I won't cooperate with you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

371
00:27:11,560 --> 00:27:12,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go find someone else.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

372
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:03,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kan!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

373
00:28:08,280 --> 00:28:09,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop! Stop it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

374
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

375
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:39,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't follow him!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

376
00:28:39,360 --> 00:28:40,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's dangerous.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

377
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:46,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you okay?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

378
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm fine. What about you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

379
00:28:48,840 --> 00:28:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not hurt.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

380
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Be careful, Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

381
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These branches have thorns.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

382
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Watch out. Don't let them scratch you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

383
00:29:24,840 --> 00:29:26,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>MAE KHANING NEWS</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

384
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:32,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have some water.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It'll make you feel better.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

385
00:29:33,840 --> 00:29:34,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thank you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

386
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:40,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you sure</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

387
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you don't want to see a doctor?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

388
00:29:43,120 --> 00:29:44,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm fine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

389
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By the way, that thug,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

390
00:29:47,840 --> 00:29:49,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>do you know who sent him?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

391
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:51,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not sure.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

392
00:29:52,840 --> 00:29:55,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I suspect Kamnan Sawaeng's men.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

393
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:58,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Has it really come</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to killing officers now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

394
00:29:59,360 --> 00:30:00,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If I'm right,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

395
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:04,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Superintendent Cheewin told Kamnan Sawaeng</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that I was in their way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

396
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Thank you so much</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

397
00:30:10,520 --> 00:30:11,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>for saving me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

398
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:15,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You have to be careful from now on.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

399
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm glad</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

400
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:21,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you still care about me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

401
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:49,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Look over there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

402
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The border is just ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

403
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:52,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And there's a small market.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

404
00:30:54,800 --> 00:30:58,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>In that case,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you and Boonrod wait here first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

405
00:30:58,280 --> 00:31:00,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want to go buy some personal supplies.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

406
00:31:01,560 --> 00:31:03,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And I'll also try to see</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

407
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:06,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>if Kamnan Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or the wanted posters are around.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

408
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:07,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Be careful, Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

409
00:31:18,760 --> 00:31:20,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My sales are so terrible. What about you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

410
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:23,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Are you looking for a wallet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Yeah.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

411
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:24,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

412
00:31:32,480 --> 00:31:33,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

413
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:34,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Excuse me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

414
00:31:35,080 --> 00:31:39,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have any sanitary pads for sale?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

415
00:31:39,120 --> 00:31:40,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We don't have that now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

416
00:31:40,960 --> 00:31:43,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We used to,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but women keep getting abducted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

417
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You should watch your back,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

418
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:47,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or you might be next.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

419
00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:50,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hurry up and get out of here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

420
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:52,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

421
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:54,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What's this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You will get abducted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

422
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, move fast!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

423
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:59,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, stop! It's a woman!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

424
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:03,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey! Let me go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

425
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:05,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Help me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

426
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:08,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let go of me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-That sounds like Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

427
00:32:08,120 --> 00:32:09,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Help me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Noona!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

428
