553
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:01,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get to work!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

554
00:41:26,520 --> 00:41:27,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

