571
00:42:33,800 --> 00:42:35,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What the hell?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

572
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:36,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's an ambush!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

573
00:42:41,120 --> 00:42:42,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Junior disciple!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

574
00:42:47,560 --> 00:42:48,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Take it easy now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

575
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait, children!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

576
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:56,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A monk?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

577
00:42:57,920 --> 00:42:59,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Everyone, lower your weapons.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

578
00:43:03,080 --> 00:43:04,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Children,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

579
00:43:04,600 --> 00:43:05,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what is going on here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

580
00:43:05,680 --> 00:43:07,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did you come from?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

581
00:43:09,880 --> 00:43:12,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, are these guys even Thai?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

582
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:13,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

583
00:43:13,920 --> 00:43:15,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Of course we are, for goodness' sake!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

584
00:43:20,080 --> 00:43:21,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait. May I ask something?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

585
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:24,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why do you have to hide away</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and ambush people like this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

586
00:43:30,440 --> 00:43:32,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>General Kao, you say?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

587
00:43:32,800 --> 00:43:33,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

588
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:36,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's the border's armed militia leader,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

589
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:40,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>dealing with human trafficking</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and weapons smuggling.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

590
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:41,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The village women</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

591
00:43:42,640 --> 00:43:44,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>were all taken by him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

592
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:45,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>As for the men,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

593
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:48,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>they use them for forced labor</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

594
00:43:48,160 --> 00:43:49,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or execute them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

595
00:43:49,600 --> 00:43:50,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Now,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

596
00:43:50,960 --> 00:43:52,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>this is all that is left.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

597
00:43:56,080 --> 00:43:57,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What a tragedy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

598
00:43:58,200 --> 00:43:59,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Piya, a teacher,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

599
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:01,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and this is Ta,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

600
00:44:01,560 --> 00:44:03,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>my teaching assistant.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

601
00:44:03,240 --> 00:44:05,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We are Thai teachers</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>living in this village.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

602
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:07,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These villagers</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

603
00:44:07,520 --> 00:44:08,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are ethnic minorities</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

604
00:44:09,400 --> 00:44:10,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from various tribes</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

605
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:12,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and regions</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

606
00:44:13,000 --> 00:44:14,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who migrated here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

607
00:44:15,560 --> 00:44:17,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They are constantly driven</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from place to place.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

608
00:44:17,320 --> 00:44:19,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Seeking help from the authorities</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

609
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:21,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is tough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

610
00:44:22,000 --> 00:44:24,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Their camp is right across the border.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

611
00:44:25,280 --> 00:44:27,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The path there is rigged with landmines.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

612
00:44:27,440 --> 00:44:28,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My people and the villagers</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

613
00:44:29,040 --> 00:44:31,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>have tried to rescue them before,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

614
00:44:31,160 --> 00:44:33,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but some died or became disabled.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

615
00:44:33,680 --> 00:44:35,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Still, we never give up.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

616
00:44:35,840 --> 00:44:37,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

617
00:44:38,080 --> 00:44:40,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you happen to have</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>any spells or amulets</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

618
00:44:40,680 --> 00:44:42,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that can protect us?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

619
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:44,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Or just holy water will do.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

620
00:44:54,000 --> 00:44:55,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We've captured almost all of them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

621
00:44:55,920 --> 00:44:56,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

622
00:44:59,320 --> 00:45:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Those kids aren't growing up fast enough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

623
00:45:05,680 --> 00:45:07,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's keep searching.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

624
00:45:10,000 --> 00:45:12,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>For us to breach their territory</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>through the landmines</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

625
00:45:12,840 --> 00:45:15,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and rescue our people,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we have two options.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

626
00:45:15,680 --> 00:45:16,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>First,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

627
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:21,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we need mine-detection equipment.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

628
00:45:22,360 --> 00:45:23,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

629
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:25,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've sent multiple official requests,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

630
00:45:25,840 --> 00:45:27,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but they've kept silent.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

631
00:45:27,960 --> 00:45:29,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Alternatively, second,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

632
00:45:30,040 --> 00:45:33,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we find one of their men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who knows the terrain well</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

633
00:45:33,200 --> 00:45:34,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to guide us through.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

634
00:45:34,920 --> 00:45:36,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

635
00:45:37,040 --> 00:45:38,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that sounds harder than the first one.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

636
00:45:39,640 --> 00:45:41,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How can we find someone like that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

637
00:45:42,880 --> 00:45:46,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, we go look for them</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>at the places where they hunt.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

638
00:45:53,120 --> 00:45:54,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Teacher!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

639
00:45:54,800 --> 00:45:57,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>General Kao's men are here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to kidnap more people!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

640
00:45:59,200 --> 00:46:00,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There you go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

641
00:46:00,280 --> 00:46:01,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Right on cue.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

642
00:46:20,200 --> 00:46:21,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Mr. Papon.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

643
00:46:34,840 --> 00:46:35,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

644
00:46:36,000 --> 00:46:38,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you shocked to see me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

645
00:46:39,440 --> 00:46:40,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, of course not.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

646
00:46:42,920 --> 00:46:43,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

647
00:46:44,640 --> 00:46:45,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You didn't tell me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

648
00:46:47,480 --> 00:46:50,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You didn't tell me either</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that you were coming to Mae Hong Son.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

649
00:46:51,680 --> 00:46:52,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

650
00:46:52,640 --> 00:46:54,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

651
00:46:56,360 --> 00:46:57,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My staff informed me</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

652
00:46:58,440 --> 00:47:01,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that a tour group</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from abroad is coming here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

653
00:47:01,120 --> 00:47:02,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So I came</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

654
00:47:02,520 --> 00:47:04,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to oversee things here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

655
00:47:05,560 --> 00:47:06,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Incredible.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

656
00:47:06,760 --> 00:47:09,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Someone of your stature has</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to oversee things in person.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

657
00:47:10,400 --> 00:47:12,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is my hotel, after all.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

658
00:47:15,640 --> 00:47:17,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is that the only reason?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

659
00:47:18,680 --> 00:47:20,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's not about the diamond, right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

660
00:47:27,440 --> 00:47:28,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was impatient.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

661
00:47:29,640 --> 00:47:31,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I wanted to follow up on my own</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

662
00:47:32,160 --> 00:47:33,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to see if there was any news.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

663
00:47:42,440 --> 00:47:44,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You must be exhausted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

664
00:47:44,120 --> 00:47:46,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think it's better if you go up and rest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

665
00:47:47,600 --> 00:47:49,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll have the staff prepare some food.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

666
00:47:50,720 --> 00:47:51,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let's go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

667
00:48:12,480 --> 00:48:13,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, little miss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

668
00:48:20,880 --> 00:48:22,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh! Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

669
00:48:23,600 --> 00:48:24,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't you dare!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

670
00:48:28,520 --> 00:48:30,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do I really look like a girl to you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

671
00:48:37,200 --> 00:48:38,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stay back!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

672
00:48:38,360 --> 00:48:39,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you going to do?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

673
00:48:40,280 --> 00:48:42,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>One more step and you'll get hurt!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

674
00:48:42,160 --> 00:48:43,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Freeze! Police!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

675
00:48:44,000 --> 00:48:48,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NEXT EPISODE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

676
00:48:49,440 --> 00:48:51,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Papon came here by himself?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

677
00:48:52,080 --> 00:48:53,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

678
00:48:53,160 --> 00:48:54,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If anything comes up,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

679
00:48:54,760 --> 00:48:56,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll keep you posted.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

680
00:49:00,280 --> 00:49:02,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's all go together.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

681
00:49:02,120 --> 00:49:03,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we do that,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

682
00:49:03,720 --> 00:49:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll all die.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

683
00:49:04,840 --> 00:49:05,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then choose</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

684
00:49:05,840 --> 00:49:07,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>whether to die now</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

685
00:49:08,080 --> 00:49:09,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or die later altogether.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

686
00:51:35,320 --> 00:51:40,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Subtitle translation by: Jarut K.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
